    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d221">

                <pb facs="0325" n="159" xml:id="pg159"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/1854</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Page to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-12-21T23:00:00+00:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 21, 1917, 11 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>8038. Your 5876 November 22, 5 p.m. Currency loan to China. Foreign Office
                    informs me to-day matter has been referred to Treasury and have promised that
                    the decision, as soon as it is reached, will be communicated to me.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Page</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
